# id|label|ufw rule|on. Each ticked rule runs "ufw <rule>" in the installed system.
# Add |on to a row to have it ticked by default. Rows without it start unticked.

# Remote Access
ssh|SSH|allow 22/tcp|on

# Web traffic
http|Web server|allow 80/tcp
https|Web server (TLS)|allow 443/tcp

# Device discovery
mdns|Multicast DNS (Avahi, device discovery)|allow 5353/udp|on
ssdp|SSDP (UPnP discovery)|allow 1900/udp|on
cups|CUPS printing (IPP, printer browsing)|allow 631

# File transfer
localsend|LocalSend|allow 53317|on
kdeconnect-tcp|KDE Connect (TCP)|allow 1714:1764/tcp
kdeconnect-udp|KDE Connect (UDP)|allow 1714:1764/udp

# Gaming
steam-remote|Steam Remote Play|allow 27031:27036/udp
steam-transfer|Steam local transfers|allow 27036:27037/tcp
